# Component Conventions

## Naming

| Type | Pattern | Location |
|------|---------|----------|
| Shared components | `PascalCase.tsx` | `src/components/` |
| Client wrappers | `*Client.tsx` | Colocated with page or in `src/features/` |
| Forms | `*Form.tsx` | Colocated with page or in `src/features/` |
| UI primitives (shadcn) | `kebab-case.tsx` | `src/components/ui/` |
| Layout components | `PascalCase.tsx` | `src/components/layout/` |

## Client components

Add `"use client"` only when the component needs:
- React hooks (`useState`, `useEffect`, `useContext`)
- Event handlers (`onClick`, `onSubmit`)
- Browser APIs (`window`, `document`)
- Third-party client libraries (Razorpay, audio player)

## Styling

- Use **Tailwind CSS v4** classes — no CSS modules, no styled-components.
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional classes (clsx + tailwind-merge).
- Use CVA (`class-variance-authority`) for component variants in `src/components/ui/`.
- Icons from `lucide-react` only.
- Dark mode is default; use `dark:` variant for light-mode overrides via `@custom-variant dark`.

## Props

```typescript
// ✅ Destructure props, use TypeScript interfaces
interface BeatCardProps {
  beat: PublicBeat;
  startingPrice?: number | null;
  priority?: boolean;
}

export default function BeatCard({ beat, startingPrice, priority }: BeatCardProps) { ... }
